Package: omicsDesk
Title: Offline, Single-Machine Edition of omicsApp
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Weilin", "Pu", email = "puweilin@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Runs the omicsApp multi-omics analysis interface on one machine
    with no network access. Every analysis backend the app can call is a hard
    dependency rather than an optional one, the MSigDB gene-set tables are
    shipped with the package so enrichment never needs to download anything,
    and launch() puts projects, gene sets and reports in one visible folder
    that survives between sessions. Ships the tooling that builds an
    installable offline bundle (a local CRAN-style repository of binaries
    plus an installer) for a given platform and R version.
